    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Aquila Kill Team",
    "summary": "Against an attack on a mixed-Toughness Aquila Kill Team, take the Toughness from the largest group of models sharing that characteristic. Resolve ties in favour of the highest tied value. Keep using that value for Wound rolls until the attacking models finish their attacks. For Embarking, each Gravis Veteran uses two model spaces and can ride in Transports that accept comparable models from other units, even though the Kill Team lacks the GRAVIS keyword.",
